---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | B. H. Schafer"
  description="Learn more about B. H. Schafer, a speculative fiction author writing at the edge of myth, dread, and transformation."
>
  <h1>About B. H. Schafer</h1>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <div class="surface portrait">
      <img src="/images/brandon-kindred.jpg" alt="Portrait of author B. H. Schafer" />
    </div>

    <div>
      <p>
        B. H. Schafer is a speculative fiction writer exploring the strange, the sublime, and the shadowed edges of
        the human psyche.
      </p>
      <p>
        His stories blend fantasy, horror, science fiction, and literary sensibility to examine transformation,
        isolation, and the fragile tension between identity and power.
      </p>
      <p>
        Drawing from a background in computer science and psychology, Schafer writes with structural precision and
        emotional depth, often centering flawed protagonists who confront impossible choices in mythic, destabilized
        worlds.
      </p>
      <p>
        He publishes fiction and essays through Substack and uses this site as a curated home for journal reflections,
        updates, and craft notes for readers who value atmosphere, meaning, and narrative ambition.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .portrait {
    padding: 0.6rem;
    max-width: 26rem;
  }
  .portrait img {
    border-radius: calc(var(--radius) - 0.15rem);
  }
</style>
